            "description": "## gptwc: wc for GPT tokens\n\nA simple utility for counting tokens. Uses `tiktoken`\n\nExample Usage:\n\n```\ncat logs.txt | gptwc\n\ngptwc < input.txt\n```\n\nPrints the number of tokens in the input stdin text, similar to how `wc` prints the number of words.\n\n\n",
